{"id":2266,"date":"2024-09-19T12:32:37","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:32:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2266"},"modified":"2025-10-02T11:39:02","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T11:39:02","slug":"cardboard-ring-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-ring-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Ring Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Professional Presentation for Luxury and Budget Collections<\/h2>\n<p>We at <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a> provide reliable and stylish <strong>cardboard ring boxes<\/strong> that are designed for jewelry brands, retailers, and events that require secure, compact, and brandable packaging. These boxes not only keep rings safe but also present them in a professional way. Whether you\u2019re packing luxury pieces or budget collections, we produce boxes that match your needs.<\/p>\n<p>Available in custom sizes, colors, and print finishes, our <strong>women&#8217;s cardboard ring boxes<\/strong> and unisex options are built to impress. We serve small businesses and large retailers looking for consistent quality in <strong>cardboard ring boxes wholesale<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Lightweight Boxes That Securely Hold Jewelry<\/h2>\n<h3>Built for Presentation and Protection<\/h3>\n<p>Cardboard ring boxes are commonly used in jewelry stores, eCommerce packaging, event giveaways, and retail branding. Each piece is placed securely in a cushioned insert or foam layer to prevent shifting or damage during storage and delivery.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Durable cardboard board construction<\/li>\n<li>Optional foam or velvet insert for holding rings<\/li>\n<li>Lightweight yet protective packaging for shipping<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>If you\u2019re seeking <strong>cheap ring boxes in bulk<\/strong> for promotions or day-to-day sales, we offer cost-effective and customizable solutions that still look polished.<\/p>\n<h3>Multiple Lid and Closure Styles Available<\/h3>\n<p>You can select from several formats including:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lift-off lids<\/li>\n<li>Magnetic flap closures<\/li>\n<li>Hinged boxes<\/li>\n<li>Slide-out drawer styles<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Our <strong>cardboard ring boxes with lids<\/strong> are ideal for both display and shipping. Custom printing allows your brand to stand out while the box remains compact and easy to stack.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"group relative\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Specification<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Size<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Fully custom Small, Medium, Extra Small ring sizes<\/td>\n<td>Premium Cardboard, Kraft, White SBS<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>Custom sizes, stackable designs<\/td>\n<td>Jewelry stores, Boutiques, eCommerce, Events<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Insert Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Die-cut foam, velvet insert, cardboard divider<\/td>\n<td>Foam, Velvet, Cardboard<\/td>\n<td>Soft-touch, Plush, or Plain<\/td>\n<td>Secure ring slots, Divider trays<\/td>\n<td>Single rings, Earring pairs, Collectibles<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Lid Styles<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Hinged lid, Lift-off lid, Drawer slide, Magnetic closure<\/td>\n<td>Same as box material<\/td>\n<td>Smooth, Seamless fit<\/td>\n<td>Magnetic flaps, Slide-out drawers<\/td>\n<td>Display, Shipping, Gift presentation<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Printing Support<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, One-side or Two-side print<\/td>\n<td>14pt to 24pt thickness<\/td>\n<td>Offset or Digital printing<\/td>\n<td>High-res logos, QR codes, Barcodes<\/td>\n<td>Branding, Promotional events, Retail sales<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Surface Decoration<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Foil stamping, Embossing, Debossing, QR code printing<\/td>\n<td>Cardboard, SBS<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>Metallic foil, Raised or Recessed logos<\/td>\n<td>Luxury branding, Special editions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>MOQ<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Starting at 100 units<\/td>\n<td>Cardboard, Kraft<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte<\/td>\n<td>Low minimum order quantity<\/td>\n<td>Bulk orders, Small businesses<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Shipping<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Flat-packed or Pre-assembled available<\/td>\n<td>Cardboard, Kraft<\/td>\n<td>Matte, Gloss<\/td>\n<td>Space-saving shipping, Ready-to-use<\/td>\n<td>eCommerce, Retail inventory<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Turnaround Time<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>4\u20136 Business days (Rush available)<\/td>\n<td>Cardboard, SBS<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte<\/td>\n<td>Fast production, Rush service<\/td>\n<td>Urgent orders, Event deadlines<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Sampling Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>3D mockup, Flat design preview, Physical sample available<\/td>\n<td>Cardboard<\/td>\n<td>Matte, Gloss<\/td>\n<td>Free digital proofs, Sample boxes<\/td>\n<td>Design approval, Prototyping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Free Services<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Design assistance, Nationwide delivery<\/td>\n<td>Cardboard, Kraft<\/td>\n<td>Matte, Gloss<\/td>\n<td>Free artwork setup, Delivery included<\/td>\n<td>Hassle-free ordering, Cost savings<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<div class=\"px-two bg-background border-border shadow-subtle pointer-coarse:opacity-100 right-xs absolute bottom-0 flex gap-2 rounded-lg border py-px opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\">\n<div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2 id=\"\" class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-base font-[500] first:mt-0 md:text-lg dark:font-[475] [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\">Key Feature at a Glance<\/h2>\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong>Customizable Size &amp; Inserts :<\/strong>\u00a0Perfect fit for any ring or small jewelry item.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong>Multiple Lid Styles :<\/strong>\u00a0Choose from hinged, magnetic, drawer, or lift-off lids.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong>Premium Printing &amp; Finishes :<\/strong>\u00a0Offset\/digital printing, foil stamping, embossing, gloss\/matte\/Spot UV.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong>Secure &amp; Lightweight :<\/strong>\u00a0Durable yet easy to ship; foam or velvet inserts prevent damage.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong>Bulk Pricing :<\/strong>\u00a0Affordable rates for wholesale orders with low MOQs.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong>Fast Turnaround :<\/strong>\u00a0Standard 4\u20136 days, with rush options available.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong>Free Design Support :<\/strong>\u00a0Get expert help and digital proofs at no extra cost.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Popular Use Cases<\/h3>\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\">Jewelers, boutiques, and artisans<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\">Event organizers (weddings, proposals, giveaways)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\">Subscription box brands<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\">Souvenir and handmade product sellers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong>Need reliable, branded cardboard ring boxes?<\/strong><br \/>\nContact us for a quote or request a free sample to see the quality for yourself!<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Cardboard Ring Boxes for Sale in Bulk<\/h2>\n<h3>Wholesale Packaging That Delivers Value<\/h3>\n<p>We offer <strong>cardboard ring boxes for sale<\/strong> in bulk quantities with affordable pricing for brands that need consistent packaging solutions. Whether for promotional events or daily inventory, these boxes make product display and shipping easier.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ideal for jewelers, boutiques, and artisans<\/li>\n<li>Fits single rings, small earring pairs, or collectibles<\/li>\n<li>Bulk pricing available with low minimums<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Some clients also combine ring packaging with other compact formats such as <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-boxes-with-handle\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"919\"><strong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"849\">Cardboard Boxes With Handle<\/strong><\/a>, especially for jewelry sets, giveaways, or in-store presentation. These handled boxes add portability while keeping your items secure.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Add-On Features and Custom Finishes<\/h2>\n<h3>Printing and Coating Options for Branding<\/h3>\n<p>All our ring boxes can be printed using digital or offset techniques with high clarity. Choose from finishes like:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gloss for a shiny, retail-ready finish<\/li>\n<li>Matte for a soft, muted surface<\/li>\n<li>Spot UV for highlighting logos or accents<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>This ensures that even small packages carry a professional appearance.<\/p>\n<h3>Custom Inserts for Secure Ring Placement<\/h3>\n<p>To protect your products during transit or while displayed, you can select:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Soft velvet padding<\/li>\n<li>Foam inserts with ring slots<\/li>\n<li>Divider trays for packaging multiple rings<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>These features are especially helpful for <strong>cardboard ring boxes bulk<\/strong> orders that need to maintain consistency across batches.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Use Cases and Product Fit<\/h2>\n<p>Our <strong>cardboard ring box<\/strong> designs are popular among:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Jewelers and boutique retailers<\/li>\n<li>Event organizers needing presentation boxes<\/li>\n<li>Subscription box brands offering jewelry<\/li>\n<li>Souvenir shops and handmade product sellers<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>They\u2019re also used as packaging for wedding rings, proposal boxes, and seasonal promotions. If you&#8217;re looking for <strong>women\u2019s cardboard ring boxes<\/strong> or neutral branding, we can guide you on color and print options that match your goals.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Explore More from Cardboard Boxes For Specific Uses<\/h2>\n<p>For businesses that require packaging solutions based on the product type, we offer many other formats under our <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/Cardboard-Boxes-For-Specific-Uses\/\"><strong>Cardboard Boxes For Specific Uses<\/strong><\/a> collection. You\u2019ll find options like:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Watch boxes<\/li>\n<li>Soap boxes<\/li>\n<li>Display boxes<\/li>\n<li>Promotional product boxes<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Each category is organized to help you match packaging with your industry or product size.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Shop Cardboard Boxes is the Right Partner<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>High-quality <strong>custom cardboard ring boxes<\/strong> with branding support<\/li>\n<li>Available in various shapes and insert options<\/li>\n<li>Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV coatings<\/li>\n<li>Free design help and fast digital proofs<\/li>\n<li>Quick turnaround with nationwide delivery<\/li>\n<li>Competitive wholesale pricing for bulk buyers<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Need reliable <strong>cardboard ring boxes wholesale<\/strong> or searching for <strong>cheap ring boxes in bulk<\/strong> with custom printing? Contact us now for a quote or to request a sample of your next packaging solution.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes offers premium cardboard ring boxes at wholesale prices. We also offer free design and shipping services. Customize your ring boxes with your brand&#8217;s logo or a personalized message. Our fast turnaround times ensure you receive your order quickly. Choose from our selection of standard sizes or request custom dimensions to perfectly fit your rings. Contact us today.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2402,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[182],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2266","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","produ